<title>INDIA: India RBI accepts bids for 44.5 bln rupees at repo.</title>
<headline>India RBI accepts bids for 44.5 bln rupees at repo.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it accepted all five bids it received at a repo auction on Thursday to raise 44.5 billion rupees.</p>
<p>The cut-off rate was steady at 3.60 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
